    <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
    <p><strong>Effective Date:</strong> September 2026</p>
    <p><strong>Aegis Senior Fraud Defense</strong> is developed and operated by <strong>DF Heat Labs LLC</strong>. We are committed to protecting the privacy and independence of older adults and their families.</p>
    
    <h2>1. Information We Do Not Collect</h2>
    <p>Aegis operates on a zero-credential security architecture. We do <strong>not</strong> collect, request, transmit, or store:</p>
    <ul>
        <li>Social Security numbers or government ID numbers.</li>
        <li>Bank account numbers, routing numbers, or payment card details.</li>
        <li>Online banking usernames, passwords, or PINs.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>2. On-Device Document Scanning & Analysis</h2>
    <p>When you use the scanner to evaluate suspicious mail, bills, or checks, image processing and optical character recognition (OCR) are performed on-device. Images and extracted text are not sold, shared with data brokers, or used for commercial advertising.</p>

    <h2>3. Evidence Dossier Export</h2>
    <p>The Evidence Snapshot PDF is generated locally on your device. You maintain sole custody and control over this report. It is only shared when you deliberately send it to a trusted caregiver, legal proxy, Older Adult Protective Services (OAPS), or law enforcement.</p>

    <h2>4. Helplines & Third Parties</h2>
    <p>The app provides directory shortcuts to established public helplines (such as the Philadelphia Corporation for Aging and Pennsylvania Department of Aging). Placing a call connects you through your standard cellular carrier under your carrier's terms.</p>
<h2>6. Disclaimer & Limitation of Liability</h2>
<p>
    <strong>Aegis Senior Fraud Defense</strong> is an automated educational screening application operated by <strong>DF Heat Labs LLC</strong>.
</p>
<ul>
    <li><strong>No Legal or Professional Advice:</strong> The assessments, text extractions, and summaries provided do not constitute legal, accounting, tax, or professional investigative advice.</li>
    <li><strong>No Warranty of Accuracy:</strong> Scam schemes change constantly. A safe or low-risk assessment is not a legal guarantee of legitimacy. Users must verify suspicious solicitations independently.</li>
    <li><strong>Non-Governmental Entity:</strong> Aegis is an independent utility and is not an agency of any municipal, state, or federal government, nor is it an official Older Adult Protective Services (OAPS) reporting channel.</li>
</ul>
    <h2>5. Contact Us</h2>
